  "description": "# SIP2.51: Add 1 Ark to LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDT Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 1 new Ark to the existing LazyVault_LowerRisk_USDT Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional an Ark will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0x17Ee2D03e88b55E762c66C76ec99C3A28A54AD8d\n- Number of Ark to add: 1\n\n## New Ark Address\n1. `0x268ef3412e70A7c1ACD594Fc72013385fA3Cec2c`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for the Ark\n2. Add the Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://www.2.51.com \n",
